  "description": "Monitor performance metrics, activity, breakpoints and more. Debugging with validation, log errors, and more. Inspect and edit your apps live for quicker testing.\nOn .NET 10 SDK, this package shouldn't be used directly. Please install \"AvaloniaUI.DeveloperTools\" instead.",
